[{:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-340367"] :question/problem "$$\n⟨f(x),g(x)⟩={\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }f(x)g(x)\\,\\text{d}x\n$$\n\nGiven the inner product on the set of continuous functions over $x\\in [-\\pi ,\\pi )$ defined above, select the correct options below.$\\,$\n$⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x),\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)⟩=$\n{{field-1}}\n\n$\\,$\nThe functions $f(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)$ and $g(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)$ \n{{field-2}}." :question/worked-solution "We begin by using the half-angle identity\n\n$$\n{sin}^{2}⁡(3x)=\\frac{1}{2}(1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x)).\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into the integral gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x),\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)⟩ & ={\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }{sin}^{2}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={[\\frac{1}{2}x-\\frac{1}{12}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6x)]}_{-\\pi }^{\\pi } \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(\\pi -(-\\pi ))-\\frac{1}{12}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6\\pi )-(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-6\\pi )) \\\\  & =\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)$ and $g(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)$ $\\text{are not orthogonal}$ with respect to the inner product." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-340368/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "7b385cee-f562-51ce-8889-0cac72fa1968" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340368/field-1/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "82c3a7ac-58b4-55ba-a0c9-59222e0a368c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340368/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "d707a58f-d523-53a4-bf56-17c7a61b3c4d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340368/field-1/986e06f062dcc0ad37fbb185f7e0d56b0fd8e74b571035e7dc0af3d06af89951" :answer/id #uuid "90635441-91e9-5231-82e8-1f7783c24364" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\pi " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340368/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "e719573d-a1ae-52d7-8449-6d6cb14f7307" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-340368/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer-field/choices ["q-340368/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" "q-340368/field-1/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" "q-340368/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" "q-340368/field-1/986e06f062dcc0ad37fbb185f7e0d56b0fd8e74b571035e7dc0af3d06af89951"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-340368/field-2/45748e934ef4660a4b62ead5bf1f91dfb438725115d7289eb41fe950d2ed803d" :answer/id #uuid "38b55a66-370d-58db-aa01-d558179ae875" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "are orthogonal" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340368/field-2/61bbf40bf0728127bc167767b5af83361c3acbddac67f4a51d278c010c10af58" :answer/id #uuid "78a17764-272d-51ea-a2c4-425663346554" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "are not orthogonal" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340368/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "075010aa-4b9b-5ca1-934f-b98275e5e7d3" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-340368/field-2/45748e934ef4660a4b62ead5bf1f91dfb438725115d7289eb41fe950d2ed803d" :answer-field/choices ["q-340368/field-2/45748e934ef4660a4b62ead5bf1f91dfb438725115d7289eb41fe950d2ed803d" "q-340368/field-2/61bbf40bf0728127bc167767b5af83361c3acbddac67f4a51d278c010c10af58"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-340368" :question/id #uuid "1459f84b-ac32-5a32-9ee7-e5678c3f1aac" :question/math-academy-id "q-340368" :question/problem "$$\n⟨f(x),g(x)⟩={\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }f(x)g(x)\\,\\text{d}x\n$$\n\nGiven the inner product on the set of continuous functions over $x\\in [-\\pi ,\\pi )$ defined above, select the correct options below.\n\n$\\,$\n$⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x)⟩=$\n{{field-1}}\n\n$\\,$\nThe functions $f(x)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)$ and $g(x)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x)$ \n{{field-2}}." :question/worked-solution "We begin by using the product-to-sum identity\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x)=\\frac{1}{2}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(9x)).\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into the integral gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x)⟩ & ={\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)+\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(9x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={[\\frac{1}{6}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)+\\frac{1}{18}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(9x)]}_{-\\pi }^{\\pi } \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3\\pi )-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-3\\pi ))+\\frac{1}{18}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(9\\pi )-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-9\\pi )) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{6}(0-0)+\\frac{1}{18}(0-0) \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(x)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)$ and $g(x)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x)$ $\\text{are orthogonal}$ with respect to the inner product." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-340368/field-1" "q-340368/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "fadf4f64-3569-56b2-98e1-f6681892054a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-340368"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-340645/field-1/08888900a4063a5f6b96a23209cb5d0c5f47a788e36c98c71fdb65ddb209ab45" :answer/id #uuid "c4c691d6-4bec-5f7d-9461-b11507362ac2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{⟨f(x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)⟩}{⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x),\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)⟩}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340645/field-1/7325d62f39c3a309dd6bc305b5a72bb949f604039b1487a85b4027a278d92529" :answer/id #uuid "28fe17d1-4285-5906-bde9-838a72acbf5b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{⟨f(x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)⟩}{⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)⟩}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340645/field-1/ae5970f887610bcc70f20f2f77a1d0cec58dbbbc06a6ff7381f016c0072de598" :answer/id #uuid "392f2ae5-4681-5ea2-88ed-aeca503d62fa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x),\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)⟩}{⟨f(x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)⟩}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340645/field-1/735ab2673dfc972b59297b919443f474477c47f454827f658ce0a42cefc149d8" :answer/id #uuid "a18dc9b6-138d-508e-b1d9-312231093fef" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)⟩}{⟨f(x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)⟩}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340645/field-1/54bd993c9957b3f49108f2caafbbb3800ff87f21e4b05ff64a41602eefa31911" :answer/id #uuid "556a2fc0-5ef3-55ec-a341-2adecb3d35d6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{⟨f(x),\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)⟩}{⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x),\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)⟩}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340645/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "78f18f00-73d5-5f5a-9835-b67df8752c5c" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-340645/field-1/7325d62f39c3a309dd6bc305b5a72bb949f604039b1487a85b4027a278d92529" :answer-field/choices ["q-340645/field-1/08888900a4063a5f6b96a23209cb5d0c5f47a788e36c98c71fdb65ddb209ab45" "q-340645/field-1/7325d62f39c3a309dd6bc305b5a72bb949f604039b1487a85b4027a278d92529" "q-340645/field-1/ae5970f887610bcc70f20f2f77a1d0cec58dbbbc06a6ff7381f016c0072de598" "q-340645/field-1/735ab2673dfc972b59297b919443f474477c47f454827f658ce0a42cefc149d8" "q-340645/field-1/54bd993c9957b3f49108f2caafbbb3800ff87f21e4b05ff64a41602eefa31911"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-340645/field-2/b70aae751b2c8b3e9e8a13d794a4d2996d95172e6176a2e8db9c2f456750b489" :answer/id #uuid "2dd35ddf-d808-58e4-a17f-78e304437bda" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\pi }" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340645/field-2/d027d90726f5bdbf1525aade1b6bde5c85e2082f2b792dfacee399fcc90e9833" :answer/id #uuid "9b3025ad-9f0d-594d-abd8-d2695cf45ea8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340645/field-2/a319e2074b264fdb964c2b6eb43d32d763280e23b0599a55d545f0a58e6fea9e" :answer/id #uuid "631df65d-6bfc-5712-97c7-b395d9c82d4e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{\\pi }" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340645/field-2/167ebf11c001034e2cbb5c82fd03c6c789b33fae94a34649b1567e72676329e0" :answer/id #uuid "336b8de6-7b9f-52c9-ba79-b259d1cf021d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2\\pi }" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340645/field-2/adbad78d33491a071139fe589fefda7e9ba65cf97ebbcae14d252ac90459e198" :answer/id #uuid "b9c705c3-1772-51a1-ae9d-0071f10d2d41" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340645/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "07b375b3-4146-5c3a-9f79-9e890ed09a4d" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-340645/field-2/b70aae751b2c8b3e9e8a13d794a4d2996d95172e6176a2e8db9c2f456750b489" :answer-field/choices ["q-340645/field-2/b70aae751b2c8b3e9e8a13d794a4d2996d95172e6176a2e8db9c2f456750b489" "q-340645/field-2/d027d90726f5bdbf1525aade1b6bde5c85e2082f2b792dfacee399fcc90e9833" "q-340645/field-2/a319e2074b264fdb964c2b6eb43d32d763280e23b0599a55d545f0a58e6fea9e" "q-340645/field-2/167ebf11c001034e2cbb5c82fd03c6c789b33fae94a34649b1567e72676329e0" "q-340645/field-2/adbad78d33491a071139fe589fefda7e9ba65cf97ebbcae14d252ac90459e198"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-340645/field-3/b85c2e5d9dfb6fc2f578362e0eb3ca9dfbfbacc2474d9aee73b46a950d723886" :answer/id #uuid "62e7b26d-281f-5a03-97f3-b32117181d53" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }({x}^{4}-7x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340645/field-3/ef7b500772e7622629d456bded953d252fbc5d9a9c9b3f84eb794418e4a95a9a" :answer/id #uuid "39c33180-4d23-54bf-a8d5-2be7da3d182a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }({x}^{4}-7x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340645/field-3/174b85679b5a354015ba2d6f64f2a36efc3bbbf3f7db97e55dcaaa453d17bce8" :answer/id #uuid "7d006c02-f526-5a73-a55b-615f62ca915b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }({x}^{4}-7x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340645/field-3/3a6cd42238c6bcee4eb9758ae883446f7e6a4138a0a715760ad9d8e7958996ad" :answer/id #uuid "a6241a4b-5f5f-5c47-9164-dec4cadfc8dc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }({x}^{4}-7x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340645/field-3/58a9daba7bc9537863276d81046cb1933c8131ace8d58ec4a8c7de564ffd8b53" :answer/id #uuid "d06fe409-030c-5798-ad2c-97f854c705c1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }({x}^{4}-7x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340645/field-3/eeaa9a287b8e83396c6bf38c1f39ce740c52e4eec257b9996c3c95bfa6af39b8" :answer/id #uuid "b843e108-61dd-59f5-9a74-6e24a17db52c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }({x}^{4}-7x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340645/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "ea79edc9-5001-5650-95d5-8a95ec1fddf2" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-340645/field-3/b85c2e5d9dfb6fc2f578362e0eb3ca9dfbfbacc2474d9aee73b46a950d723886" :answer-field/choices ["q-340645/field-3/b85c2e5d9dfb6fc2f578362e0eb3ca9dfbfbacc2474d9aee73b46a950d723886" "q-340645/field-3/ef7b500772e7622629d456bded953d252fbc5d9a9c9b3f84eb794418e4a95a9a" "q-340645/field-3/174b85679b5a354015ba2d6f64f2a36efc3bbbf3f7db97e55dcaaa453d17bce8" "q-340645/field-3/3a6cd42238c6bcee4eb9758ae883446f7e6a4138a0a715760ad9d8e7958996ad" "q-340645/field-3/58a9daba7bc9537863276d81046cb1933c8131ace8d58ec4a8c7de564ffd8b53" "q-340645/field-3/eeaa9a287b8e83396c6bf38c1f39ce740c52e4eec257b9996c3c95bfa6af39b8"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-340645" :question/id #uuid "13f82e1b-2f3e-536a-8bb2-1fc6ddf6b76a" :question/math-academy-id "q-340645" :question/problem "Let $F(x)={x}^{4}-7x$ for $x\\in R,$ and let $f(x)$ be the $2\\pi $-periodic extension of $F$ from $x\\in [0,2\\pi )$ to $x\\in R.$ The Fourier series of $f$ is given by\n\n$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }({a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx)).\n$$\n\nSelect the correct options in the expression for the coefficient ${a}_{3}$ below, where $⟨\\,,⟩$ denotes the usual inner product on functions over $[0,2\\pi ).$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{3} & ={{field-1}} \\\\  & ={{field-2}}\\,\\cdot \\,{{field-3}}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The usual inner product of functions $f$ and $g$ over $x\\in [0,2\\pi )$ is given by\n\n$$\n⟨f(x),g(x)⟩={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }f(x)g(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nFor a $2\\pi $-periodic function $f(x)$ that is piecewise continuous over $x\\in [0,2\\pi ),$ the Fourier series of $f$ is given by \n\n$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }({a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx)),\n$$\n\nwhere ${a}_{0},$ ${a}_{n},$ and ${b}_{n}$ are constants to be determined. \n\nNow, we find the inner product of $f(x)$ with $\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨f(x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)⟩ & = \\\\ ⟨\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }({a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx)),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)⟩ & = \\\\ ⟨\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2},\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)⟩+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }⟨{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)⟩+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }⟨{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)⟩ & = \\\\ \\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}⟨1,\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)⟩+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)⟩+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{b}_{n}⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the functions\n$1,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x),\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2x),…$\nare orthogonal with respect to the defined inner product, the only nonzero term in the final expression above is\n\n$$\n{a}_{3}⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)⟩.\n$$\n\nComputing the inner product, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)⟩ & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }{cos}^{2}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={[\\frac{1}{2}x+\\frac{1}{12}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6x)]}_{0}^{2\\pi } \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(2\\pi -0)-\\frac{1}{12}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(12\\pi )-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(0)) \\\\  & =\\pi .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we obtain that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨f(x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)⟩ & ={a}_{3}⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)⟩ \\\\ {a}_{3} & =\\frac{⟨f(x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)⟩}{⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)⟩} \\\\ {a}_{3} & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }f(x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }\\cdot {\\int }_{0}^{2\\pi }({x}^{4}-7x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-340645/field-1" "q-340645/field-2" "q-340645/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "304c015d-cbb6-5989-a102-d6f0f5f38604"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-340645"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-340652/field-1/0b5478be38e066f3f9ccad45d12c0431b5f5e207e684f49a1a2d09aacc2829ce" :answer/id #uuid "81df888b-2984-575e-8c9d-960769efc883" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)⟩}{⟨f(x),\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)⟩}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340652/field-1/fb2c5b29d4c40d0ec5e0646269ee86c59696ef6e4341c3ce22134fdcf2d034e1" :answer/id #uuid "c7049957-803e-522f-a66e-25a2e95a2f1d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{⟨f(x),\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)⟩}{⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)⟩}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340652/field-1/934e13f3929127fc32d36053865e870dfac16fa9a269938eddb48d0c5e19e29a" :answer/id #uuid "e806a394-afb6-5100-a368-06e6dd5f71fb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x),\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)⟩}{⟨f(x),\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)⟩}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340652/field-1/ee8f51f8de97c712111243f989ef2929bd14a15753480d316a98ef9da4ecc1ca" :answer/id #uuid "0933ff82-aa8a-5063-be35-4187e3442ac6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{⟨f(x),\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)⟩}{⟨\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x),\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)⟩}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340652/field-1/01ead8253f26db744369c0ee0a10ccde3064b560f7d8dbf95f0e2151f8586fd1" :answer/id #uuid "78efb31a-c0f3-5649-a894-2533791484b4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{⟨f(x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)⟩}{⟨\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x),\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)⟩}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-340652/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "d852c5f1-3b34-5d43-8421-331ef79f4ee0" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-340652/field-1/ee8f51f8de97c7121